Package: rapidggwizard
Title: Browser-Based Point-and-Click Builder for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: person("Alek", "Rutkowski", email = "alek.rutkowski@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A browser wizard for building ggplot2 charts visually with WebR or a local R backend. The app provides drag-and-drop aesthetic mappings, visual plot templates, rich styling controls, reproducible R code, JSON state export and import, and chart export to SVG, PNG, PDF, JPG, TIFF, and EMF.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
